---Details about an Amazon Inspector finding.
---@class aws.inspector2.Finding
---@field findingArn aws.inspector2.FindingArn The Amazon Resource Number (ARN) of the finding.
---@field awsAccountId aws.inspector2.AccountId The Amazon Web Services account ID associated with the finding.
---@field type aws.inspector2.FindingType The type of the finding. The type value determines the valid values for resource in your request. For more information, see Finding types in the Amazon Inspector user guide.
---@field description aws.inspector2.FindingDescription The description of the finding.
---@field title? aws.inspector2.FindingTitle The title of the finding.
---@field remediation aws.inspector2.Remediation An object that contains the details about how to remediate a finding.
---@field severity aws.inspector2.Severity The severity of the finding. UNTRIAGED applies to PACKAGE_VULNERABILITY type findings that the vendor has not assigned a severity yet. For more information, see Severity levels for findings in the Amazon Inspector user guide.
---@field firstObservedAt aws.inspector2.DateTimeTimestamp The date and time that the finding was first observed.
---@field lastObservedAt aws.inspector2.DateTimeTimestamp The date and time the finding was last observed. This timestamp for this field remains unchanged until a finding is updated.
---@field updatedAt? aws.inspector2.DateTimeTimestamp The date and time the finding was last updated at.
---@field status aws.inspector2.FindingStatus The status of the finding.
---@field resources aws.inspector2.ResourceList Contains information on the resources involved in a finding. The resource value determines the valid values for type in your request. For more information, see Finding types in the Amazon Inspector user guide.
---@field inspectorScore? number The Amazon Inspector score given to the finding.
---@field inspectorScoreDetails? aws.inspector2.InspectorScoreDetails An object that contains details of the Amazon Inspector score.
